sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Open a project doc
  accDescr: The editor asks the library for a doc, the store reads it, and a conflict check runs before the page renders.
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant E as Editor
  participant L as Library
  participant S as Store
  U->>E: Open "Payment flow"
  E->>L: load_doc(id)
  L->>S: read(path)
  S-->>L: bytes
  alt file changed on disk
    L-->>E: Conflict(revision)
    E-->>U: Show conflict banner
  else clean
    L-->>E: Document
    E-->>U: Render page
  end
